Explain
Total number of atoms in the system
The connection of every atom(Bond,Angle,Dihedral Angle)
The value of each relationship(Bond,Angle,Dihedral Angle)
Atomic sequence of system


When the input file is ready, run the program(./zmat_to_cart)

